{"id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-curry-howard.md","title":"Curry-Howard Correspondence","display":"df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-curry-howard","aliases":["72-df-curry-howard"],"display":"df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence","depends_on":["[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","[[72-df-system-f]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.3 §3.2 print15–17; ch.11 §11.6 print93","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","source_review_2026_10_23":"Handbook I §3.1.5 print68–69/PDF80–81 and X §3.11 print751–752/PDF763–764 checked; local STLC tree encoding distinguished from Nuprl and supplementary System F","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"review_2026_10_23_comprehensive":"局部β/η域类型独立量化，并固定可类型推导载体；本地结构对应复核"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-curry-howard"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-curry-howard</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-curry-howard — Curry-Howard Correspondence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.3 §3.2 print15–17; ch.11 §11.6 print93"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"source_review_2026_10_23","html":"Handbook I §3.1.5 print68–69/PDF80–81 and X §3.11 print751–752/PDF763–764 checked; local STLC tree encoding distinguished from Nuprl and supplementary System F"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23_comprehensive","html":"局部β/η域类型独立量化，并固定可类型推导载体；本地结构对应复核"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-curry-howard-—-Curry–Howard-Correspondence\">df-curry-howard — Curry–Howard Correspondence</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\">\\(s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}\\)</span>；类型、项、原始项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 与商上的两种代入分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a>。原始类型集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\to\">\\(s=\\to\\)</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=F\">\\(s=F\\)</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_s\">\\(\\kappa_s\\)</span> 是下式的原始类型到公共类型接口的映射。命题语法就是相应类型语法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ctx}_s\">\\(\\operatorname{Ctx}_s\\)</span> 取对应类型系统的有限偏函数上下文集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_s\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>；分数中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\\)</span> 是下式明确给出的三元组编码，不预设其可导性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^{\\mathrm r},i^{\\mathrm r},e^{\\mathrm r},I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(a^{\\mathrm r},i^{\\mathrm r},e^{\\mathrm r},I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 是互异原始证明树构造标签。原始语法及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r},J^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r},J^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 的递归中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历相应原始类型集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,e\">\\(d,e\\)</span> 遍历相应原始证明树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_t\">\\(x\\in V_t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V_T\">\\(U\\in V_T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 只用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=F\">\\(s=F\\)</span>。两个原始映射只更换构造标签；证明的绑定等价由项语法中已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_\\alpha\">\\(=_\\alpha\\)</span> 拉回，再构造证明商集。</li>\n<li>完成商构造后，规则与归约中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,e,f\\in\\mathcal D_s\">\\(d,e,f\\in\\mathcal D_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,i,e,I,E\">\\(a,i,e,I,E\\)</span> 指下式诱导的商构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CH},J\">\\(\\operatorname{CH},J\\)</span> 也指商上的诱导函数；项变量及类型变量在商语法位置按相应变量树的类读取。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\\)</span> 无绑定者，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_\\to\">\\(\\kappa_\\to\\)</span> 保留其原始类型记号。</li>\n<li>归约固定外部上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 和结果类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\approx_{s,\\Gamma,A}\">\\(\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\approx_{s,\\Gamma,A}\\)</span> 局部简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_s,\\epsilon_s,\\approx_s\">\\(\\delta_s,\\epsilon_s,\\approx_s\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square_D\">\\(\\square_D\\)</span> 是与证明构造标签不同的孔标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 遍历下式的单孔构造式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_s^D\">\\(\\mathcal K_s^D\\)</span>，其填孔递归沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的严格子树进行。context 的绑定变量标签保持固定，context 本身不另取商；局部抽象的域类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 独立遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_s\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\)</span>。每个生成对均限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)^2\\)</span>，星号零步关系也取该载体上的恒等关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_s^D\">\\(\\mathcal K_s^D\\)</span> 的文法及填孔递归左侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,e,I,E\">\\(i,e,I,E\\)</span> 是带孔构造式的自由标签；递归右侧同名符号是前面定义的商函数。填孔完成前不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 当成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_s\">\\(\\mathcal D_s\\)</span> 的元素传给这些商函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,\\qquad\n\\kappa_\\to(A):=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}),\\qquad\n\\kappa_F(A):=[A]_\\alpha\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}&amp;::=a^{\\mathrm r}(x)\\mid i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r})\\mid e^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r},\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}&amp;::=a^{\\mathrm r}(x)\\mid i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid e^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r},\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid I^{\\mathrm r}(U,\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid E^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r},A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(a^{\\mathrm r}(x))&amp;:=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,d))&amp;:=\\lambda x:A.\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e^{\\mathrm r}(d,e))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,d))&amp;:=\\Lambda U.\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(E^{\\mathrm r}(d,B))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)[B],\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(x)&amp;:=a^{\\mathrm r}(x),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(\\lambda x:A.M)&amp;:=i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,J^{\\mathrm r}(M)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(MN)&amp;:=e^{\\mathrm r}(J^{\\mathrm r}(M),J^{\\mathrm r}(N)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=I^{\\mathrm r}(U,J^{\\mathrm r}(M)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(M[B])&amp;:=E^{\\mathrm r}(J^{\\mathrm r}(M),B),\\\\\nd\\sim_s^\\alpha e&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)=_\\alpha\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e),\\\\\n[d]_s&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}:d\\sim_s^\\alpha e\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal D_s:=\\{[d]_s:d\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,\\qquad\n\\kappa_\\to(A):=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}),\\qquad\n\\kappa_F(A):=[A]_\\alpha\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}&amp;::=a^{\\mathrm r}(x)\\mid i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r})\\mid e^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r},\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}&amp;::=a^{\\mathrm r}(x)\\mid i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid e^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r},\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid I^{\\mathrm r}(U,\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid E^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r},A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(a^{\\mathrm r}(x))&amp;:=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,d))&amp;:=\\lambda x:A.\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e^{\\mathrm r}(d,e))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,d))&amp;:=\\Lambda U.\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(E^{\\mathrm r}(d,B))&amp;:=\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)[B],\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(x)&amp;:=a^{\\mathrm r}(x),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(\\lambda x:A.M)&amp;:=i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,J^{\\mathrm r}(M)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(MN)&amp;:=e^{\\mathrm r}(J^{\\mathrm r}(M),J^{\\mathrm r}(N)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=I^{\\mathrm r}(U,J^{\\mathrm r}(M)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(M[B])&amp;:=E^{\\mathrm r}(J^{\\mathrm r}(M),B),\\\\\nd\\sim_s^\\alpha e&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)=_\\alpha\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e),\\\\\n[d]_s&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}:d\\sim_s^\\alpha e\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal D_s:=\\{[d]_s:d\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na(x)&amp;:=[a^{\\mathrm r}(x)]_s,\\\\\ni(x,\\kappa_s(A),[d]_s)&amp;:=[i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,d)]_s,\\qquad\ne([d]_s,[e]_s):=[e^{\\mathrm r}(d,e)]_s,\\\\\nI(U,[d]_F)&amp;:=[I^{\\mathrm r}(U,d)]_F,\\qquad\nE([d]_F,\\kappa_F(B)):=[E^{\\mathrm r}(d,B)]_F,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}([d]_s)&amp;:=[\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)]_\\alpha,\\qquad\nJ([M]_\\alpha):=[J^{\\mathrm r}(M)]_s.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na(x)&amp;:=[a^{\\mathrm r}(x)]_s,\\\\\ni(x,\\kappa_s(A),[d]_s)&amp;:=[i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,d)]_s,\\qquad\ne([d]_s,[e]_s):=[e^{\\mathrm r}(d,e)]_s,\\\\\nI(U,[d]_F)&amp;:=[I^{\\mathrm r}(U,d)]_F,\\qquad\nE([d]_F,\\kappa_F(B)):=[E^{\\mathrm r}(d,B)]_F,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}([d]_s)&amp;:=[\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)]_\\alpha,\\qquad\nJ([M]_\\alpha):=[J^{\\mathrm r}(M)]_s.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_\\to^D&amp;::=\\square_D\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal K_\\to^D)\n\\mid e(\\mathcal K_\\to^D,d)\\mid e(d,\\mathcal K_\\to^D),\\\\\n\\mathcal K_F^D&amp;::=\\square_D\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal K_F^D)\n\\mid e(\\mathcal K_F^D,d)\\mid e(d,\\mathcal K_F^D)\n\\mid I(U,\\mathcal K_F^D)\\mid E(\\mathcal K_F^D,A),\\\\\n\\square_D[d]&amp;:=d,\\\\\ni(x,A,C)[d]&amp;:=i(x,A,C[d]),\\\\\ne(C,f)[d]&amp;:=e(C[d],f),\\qquad e(f,C)[d]:=e(f,C[d]),\\\\\nI(U,C)[d]&amp;:=I(U,C[d])\\quad(s=F),\\\\\nE(C,A)[d]&amp;:=E(C[d],A)\\quad(s=F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_\\to^D&amp;::=\\square_D\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal K_\\to^D)\n\\mid e(\\mathcal K_\\to^D,d)\\mid e(d,\\mathcal K_\\to^D),\\\\\n\\mathcal K_F^D&amp;::=\\square_D\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal K_F^D)\n\\mid e(\\mathcal K_F^D,d)\\mid e(d,\\mathcal K_F^D)\n\\mid I(U,\\mathcal K_F^D)\\mid E(\\mathcal K_F^D,A),\\\\\n\\square_D[d]&amp;:=d,\\\\\ni(x,A,C)[d]&amp;:=i(x,A,C[d]),\\\\\ne(C,f)[d]&amp;:=e(C[d],f),\\qquad e(f,C)[d]:=e(f,C[d]),\\\\\nI(U,C)[d]&amp;:=I(U,C[d])\\quad(s=F),\\\\\nE(C,A)[d]&amp;:=E(C[d],A)\\quad(s=F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nU_s^D&amp;:=\\operatorname{Ctx}_s\\times\\mathcal D_s\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_s,\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash d:A):=\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{b,s}^D&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash a(x):A}:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash i(x,A,d):A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash e(d,e):B}\\right\\},\\\\\nR_\\to^D&amp;:=R_{b,\\to}^D,\\\\\nR_F^D&amp;:=R_{b,F}^D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash I(U,d):\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash E(d,B):A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)&amp;:=\\{d:\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_s^D}(R_s^D)\\},\\\\\nd[e/x]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[\\operatorname{CH}(e)/x]),\\\\\nd[B/U]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B/U])\\quad(s=F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nU_s^D&amp;:=\\operatorname{Ctx}_s\\times\\mathcal D_s\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_s,\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash d:A):=\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{b,s}^D&amp;:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash a(x):A}:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash i(x,A,d):A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash e(d,e):B}\\right\\},\\\\\nR_\\to^D&amp;:=R_{b,\\to}^D,\\\\\nR_F^D&amp;:=R_{b,F}^D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash I(U,d):\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash E(d,B):A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)&amp;:=\\{d:\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_s^D}(R_s^D)\\},\\\\\nd[e/x]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[\\operatorname{CH}(e)/x]),\\\\\nd[B/U]&amp;:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B/U])\\quad(s=F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[e(i(x,B,d),f)],C[d[f/x]]\\rangle:B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[E(I(U,d),B)],C[d[B/U]]\\rangle:s=F\\},\\\\\n\\epsilon_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[i(x,B,e(d,a(x)))],C[d]\\rangle:B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[I(U,E(d,U))],C[d]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\},\\\\\n\\approx_s&amp;:=(\\delta_s\\cup\\epsilon_s\\cup\\delta_s^{-1}\\cup\\epsilon_s^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[e(i(x,B,d),f)],C[d[f/x]]\\rangle:B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[E(I(U,d),B)],C[d[B/U]]\\rangle:s=F\\},\\\\\n\\epsilon_s&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[i(x,B,e(d,a(x)))],C[d]\\rangle:B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[I(U,E(d,U))],C[d]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\},\\\\\n\\approx_s&amp;:=(\\delta_s\\cup\\epsilon_s\\cup\\delta_s^{-1}\\cup\\epsilon_s^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原始映射是互逆的有限树构造标签变换；用项的既有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 关系拉回证明绑定等价，给出证明商及两个诱导映射的明确定义。类型注解先在原始类型树中处理，再经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_s\">\\(\\kappa_s\\)</span> 进入公开类型接口，因而没有把已取商的类型直接塞进原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 递归。证明规则及所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta/\\epsilon\">\\(\\delta/\\epsilon\\)</span> 生成元保持原有数学范围。子树提取必须先选择原始代表，不能自动成为此商上的函数。</p>\n<p>构造项在此就是带变量标记、固定上下文约定的自然演绎树编码；不存在额外“Realize”原语。J与CH的有限树递归直接互逆，故用于定义证明代入不循环。→规则只对应最小直觉主义蕴含片段；F另含二阶命题全称。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23补充审修：原最后几式已固定结果类型A，却仍用A标注每个局部抽象，使局部β/η域类型被意外限制。现以独立的B给出全部合法局部抽象；例如结果为基类型而绑定函数类型的β步也被登记。每个生成对的两端保持同一外部判断；这项修订不把不同上下文或不同结果类型的证明混成同一商。混合类型实例见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e05ae99926179fce\" href=\"?note=e05ae99926179fce\" title=\"72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex\">72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex</a>，该链接是后续例子，不是定义前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-curry-howard-—-Curry–Howard-Correspondence","text":"df-curry-howard — Curry–Howard Correspondence","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-f]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；类型、项、原始项集合 $\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}$ 与商上的两种代入分别使用 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]、[[72-df-system-f]]。原始类型集在 $s=\\to$ 时取 $\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$，在 $s=F$ 时取 $\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}$；$\\kappa_s$ 是下式的原始类型到公共类型接口的映射。命题语法就是相应类型语法。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；类型、项、原始项集合 $\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}$ 与商上的两种代入分别使用 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]、[[72-df-system-f]]。原始类型集在 $s=\\to$ 时取 $\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$，在 $s=F$ 时取 $\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}$；$\\kappa_s$ 是下式的原始类型到公共类型接口的映射。命题语法就是相应类型语法。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ctx}_s$ 取对应类型系统的有限偏函数上下文集合，$\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_s$。$\\operatorname{Cl}$ 使用 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]；分数中的 $\\Gamma\\vdash d:A$ 是下式明确给出的三元组编码，不预设其可导性。","embed":false},{"target":"72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex","status":"resolved","id":"e05ae99926179fce","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"2026-10-23补充审修：原最后几式已固定结果类型A，却仍用A标注每个局部抽象，使局部β/η域类型被意外限制。现以独立的B给出全部合法局部抽象；例如结果为基类型而绑定函数类型的β步也被登记。每个生成对的两端保持同一外部判断；这项修订不把不同上下文或不同结果类型的证明混成同一商。混合类型实例见 [[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]，该链接是后续例子，不是定义前提。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"s=\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"s=F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ctx}_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash d:A","display":false},{"tex":"a^{\\mathrm r},i^{\\mathrm r},e^{\\mathrm r},I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r},J^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"d,e","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_t","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in V_T","display":false},{"tex":"I^{\\mathrm r},E^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"s=F","display":false},{"tex":"=_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"d,e,f\\in\\mathcal D_s","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s","display":false},{"tex":"a,i,e,I,E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CH},J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\approx_{s,\\Gamma,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_s,\\epsilon_s,\\approx_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\square_D","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_s^D","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_s^D","display":false},{"tex":"i,e,I,E","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}&:=\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to,\\qquad\n\\kappa_\\to(A):=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to^{\\mathrm r}),\\qquad\n\\kappa_F(A):=[A]_\\alpha\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}&::=a^{\\mathrm r}(x)\\mid i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r})\\mid e^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r},\\mathcal D_\\to^{\\mathrm r}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r}&::=a^{\\mathrm r}(x)\\mid i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid e^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r},\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid I^{\\mathrm r}(U,\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r})\\mid E^{\\mathrm r}(\\mathcal D_F^{\\mathrm r},A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(a^{\\mathrm r}(x))&:=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,d))&:=\\lambda x:A.\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e^{\\mathrm r}(d,e))&:=\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(I^{\\mathrm r}(U,d))&:=\\Lambda U.\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d),\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(E^{\\mathrm r}(d,B))&:=\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)[B],\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(x)&:=a^{\\mathrm r}(x),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(\\lambda x:A.M)&:=i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,J^{\\mathrm r}(M)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(MN)&:=e^{\\mathrm r}(J^{\\mathrm r}(M),J^{\\mathrm r}(N)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(\\Lambda U.M)&:=I^{\\mathrm r}(U,J^{\\mathrm r}(M)),\\\\\nJ^{\\mathrm r}(M[B])&:=E^{\\mathrm r}(J^{\\mathrm r}(M),B),\\\\\nd\\sim_s^\\alpha e&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)=_\\alpha\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(e),\\\\\n[d]_s&:=\\{e\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}:d\\sim_s^\\alpha e\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal D_s:=\\{[d]_s:d\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na(x)&:=[a^{\\mathrm r}(x)]_s,\\\\\ni(x,\\kappa_s(A),[d]_s)&:=[i^{\\mathrm r}(x,A,d)]_s,\\qquad\ne([d]_s,[e]_s):=[e^{\\mathrm r}(d,e)]_s,\\\\\nI(U,[d]_F)&:=[I^{\\mathrm r}(U,d)]_F,\\qquad\nE([d]_F,\\kappa_F(B)):=[E^{\\mathrm r}(d,B)]_F,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CH}([d]_s)&:=[\\operatorname{CH}^{\\mathrm r}(d)]_\\alpha,\\qquad\nJ([M]_\\alpha):=[J^{\\mathrm r}(M)]_s.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_\\to^D&::=\\square_D\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal K_\\to^D)\n\\mid e(\\mathcal K_\\to^D,d)\\mid e(d,\\mathcal K_\\to^D),\\\\\n\\mathcal K_F^D&::=\\square_D\\mid i(x,A,\\mathcal K_F^D)\n\\mid e(\\mathcal K_F^D,d)\\mid e(d,\\mathcal K_F^D)\n\\mid I(U,\\mathcal K_F^D)\\mid E(\\mathcal K_F^D,A),\\\\\n\\square_D[d]&:=d,\\\\\ni(x,A,C)[d]&:=i(x,A,C[d]),\\\\\ne(C,f)[d]&:=e(C[d],f),\\qquad e(f,C)[d]:=e(f,C[d]),\\\\\nI(U,C)[d]&:=I(U,C[d])\\quad(s=F),\\\\\nE(C,A)[d]&:=E(C[d],A)\\quad(s=F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nU_s^D&:=\\operatorname{Ctx}_s\\times\\mathcal D_s\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_s,\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash d:A):=\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{b,s}^D&:=\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash a(x):A}:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash d:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash i(x,A,d):A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash e(d,e):B}\\right\\},\\\\\nR_\\to^D&:=R_{b,\\to}^D,\\\\\nR_F^D&:=R_{b,F}^D\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash I(U,d):\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash d:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash E(d,B):A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Der}_s(\\Gamma,A)&:=\\{d:\\langle\\Gamma,d,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_s^D}(R_s^D)\\},\\\\\nd[e/x]&:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[\\operatorname{CH}(e)/x]),\\\\\nd[B/U]&:=J(\\operatorname{CH}(d)[B/U])\\quad(s=F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_s&:=\\{\\langle C[e(i(x,B,d),f)],C[d[f/x]]\\rangle:B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[E(I(U,d),B)],C[d[B/U]]\\rangle:s=F\\},\\\\\n\\epsilon_s&:=\\{\\langle C[i(x,B,e(d,a(x)))],C[d]\\rangle:B\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_s\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[I(U,E(d,U))],C[d]\\rangle:s=F\\land U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\operatorname{CH}(d))\\},\\\\\n\\approx_s&:=(\\delta_s\\cup\\epsilon_s\\cup\\delta_s^{-1}\\cup\\epsilon_s^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta/\\epsilon","display":false}],"bytes":8659,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是证明对象的集合，$R\\subseteq X\\times X$ 为明确给定的一步归约关系；不预设其正规化或合流。用于类型化自然演绎时，$X$ 可取 [[72-df-curry-howard]] 的有限推导树，$R$ 取其中定义的 detour 归约。"},{"id":"e1876c63cf3f1fb2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-curry-howard]] 的原始证明树 $\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}$、证明绑定等价 $\\sim_s^\\alpha$、商集 $\\mathcal D_s$ 及原始构造标签；$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$，$d\\in\\mathcal D_s$，$r,t\\in\\mathcal D_s^{\\mathrm r}$。"},{"id":"e05ae99926179fce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$o\\in\\mathsf B$；$x,y,f,h\\in V_t$ 两两互异。类型、项和 $\\vdash_\\to$ 取 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]；$J,\\operatorname{CH},\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A}$ 取 [[72-df-curry-howard]]。$j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"a07a3ec2073ac7ee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；$\\operatorname{Der}_s,\\operatorname{CH},J,\\approx_s$ 使用 [[72-df-curry-howard]]；$\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)=\\{M:\\Gamma\\vdash_sM:A\\}$。以下关系仅取同一类型、同一上下文的两端。"}],"outgoing":["e38d92d6727e7ead","a59aab1599221f4a","a77f51439d01d542","e05ae99926179fce"]}